MIT PERMISSION AND WARRANTY TEXT SHARED BY EVERY xv6 PORT IN THIS REPOSITORY

Every port under forks/ grants the same standard MIT permission and
disclaims warranty in the same words, so that text is kept here once
instead of being repeated fourteen times. The top-level LICENSE carries
it too, for ports with no copyright of their own beyond MIT's; a handful
of forks/<name>/LICENSE files exist only because that port genuinely has
its own copyright holder on top of MIT's, and each keeps just that
notice plus a pointer here instead of repeating this text again.

